<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251204__20251204_zo4x4O0Aqkee"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-04" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000030" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

