mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting
standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_909_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20251204__20251204_zbcABxa2dRm1"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-04" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000031" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

